        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "general",
          "text": "A vulnerability was found in ckolivas lrzip up to 0.651. This impacts the function lzma_decompress_buf of the file stream.c. Performing a manipulation results in use after free. Attacking locally is a requirement. The exploit has been made public and could be used. The project was informed of the problem early through an issue report but has not responded yet.",
          "title": "CVE description"
        }
      ],
